			"notes": "## What's Changed\n\n### Improved player fetching\n- Requests now have proper timeouts (5s connect, 8s per lookup) so a slow API no longer stalls lookups.\n- Failed lookups retry with exponential backoff and jitter instead of hammering the API every 100ms.\n- HTTP 429 (rate limited) responses respect the `Retry-After` header.\n- At most 6 lookups run at the same time, so joining a lobby with 100+ players no longer floods the API.\n- \"API is down\" detection is now based on the failure rate over the last minute instead of a fixed count, which means fewer false warnings in chat.\n\n### Multi-version support\nVTiers 0.8.7 is available for Minecraft **1.21, 1.21.4, 1.21.8, 1.21.11, 26.1, 26.2 and 26.3** (Fabric). Download the jar that matches your game version.\n\n| Minecraft | Java | Requires |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1.21 – 1.21.11 | 21+ | Fabric API |\n| 26.1 – 26.3 | 25+ | Fabric API |\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/IzukiNo/VTiers/compare/v0.8.6+1.21.11...v0.8.7+26.3"
		},
